&lt;p&gt;We build cinematic Next.js websites for a living, and we have just made six of them free. Each one is the full source, not a stripped "lite" copy: the same zip a paying buyer gets, with a README and step-by-step documentation. One licence covers personal and commercial use, so you can build client sites with them too. You can't resell the files as a template.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Before we released them, a script set each zip up the way a buyer would: a clean folder, &lt;code&gt;npm ci&lt;/code&gt;, a type check, a production build and a dev server, on Node 24 and Node 22. Then it opened every page at 360, 768, 1280 and 1536 px and compared it with the hosted demo. All six passed with no errors.&lt;/p&gt;

